<task id="to_create_a_new_template_51a7c7" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>To create a new template</title>
   <shortdesc>Field Name</shortdesc>
   <prolog>
      <author type="creator">Maanasa Suthrave</author>
      <critdates>
         <created date="Apr 16, 2019"/>
      </critdates>
       <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>template</keyword>
        <keyword>Author</keyword>
        <keyword>Template</keyword>
        <keyword>choose</keyword>
        <keyword>create</keyword>
        <keyword>document</keyword>
        <indexterm>template</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Author</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Template</indexterm>
      </keywords>
          <prodinfo>
        <prodname/>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <taskbody>
      <steps>
         <step>
            <cmd>Open an existing document or a blank document in Microsoft Word and log in to X-Author Contracts.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>From X-Author Contracts pane, click the left-hand menu icon  and select <b>X-Author Templates</b>.</cmd>
            <info>
               <image href="../attachments/102413222/102413307.png" width="58" height="52" placement="break">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               
            </info>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>In the X-Author Template pane, go to<b> Start &gt; Create</b>.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>In the Create New Template pane enter the following details:</cmd>
            <info>
               <table>
                  <tgroup cols="2">
                     <colspec colname="c1"/>
                     <colspec colname="c2"/>
                     <thead>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Field Name</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Description</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                     </thead>
                     <tbody>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Type</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>From the drop-down choose the type of template. You can choose from- <i>Template, Clause, and Supporting Document</i>.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Business Object</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Choose the the business object for your template from the drop-down. You can choose from- <i>clm_Agreement, cpq_Quote, bil_Invoice, and bil_CreditMemo</i>.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                     </tbody>
                  </tgroup>
               </table>
            </info>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click <b>Save</b> to confirm the template properties.</cmd>
         </step>
      </steps>
      <result>
         <p>You can now work with your template.</p>
      </result>
   </taskbody>
</task>